-site game because of lower left leg injuries.","published":"2026-09-07T04:18:07.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/49855215/brauntae-johnson-jason-onye-exit-notre-dame-opener-early","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Heisman race for Week 12: Wake Forest's Gio Lopez makes late push","description":"Much like his team, the Demon Deacons' QB has slipped under the radar much of the season -- but no more.","published":"2026-11-24T11:31:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50573849/heisman-race-wake-forest-gio-lopez","type":"Story","byline":"Bill Connelly","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Tiering the CFP favorites: Who's actually built to win on top of the odds board","description":"CFP futures got murkier after Saturday's results. But which teams can actually go far in the tournament?","published":"2026-11-24T12:03:22.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/espn/betting/story/_/id/50573806/2026-college-football-playoff-cfp-futures-odds-picks","type":"Story","byline":"Pamela Maldonado","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Who's on the College Football Playoff bubble before committee's fourth ranking?","description":"A conference-by-conference look at which teams are contending for the playoff, who's close and who's out.","published":"2026-11-24T11:29:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50575185/cfp-playoff-2026-bubble-watch-week-fourth-ranking","type":"Story","byline":"Heather Dinich","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"What qualities make the perfect coach? We're borrowing from the best","description":"If we can build a coach in a lab, we can start with these qualities and skills.","published":"2026-11-24T11:23:43.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50476785/building-perfect-coach","type":"Story","byline":"Adam Rittenberg","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"SEC to consider termination of LSU's membership at Dec. 3 meeting","description":"For the second time this year, the SEC is threatening to hold a vote of its chancellors and presidents on whether to kick LSU out of the league, according to a filing in federal court in Alabama on Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T12:52:00.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/mens-college-basketball/story/_/id/50577602/sec-consider-termination-lsu-membership","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Mark Schlabach","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Georgia defensive coordinator Glenn Schumann agrees to coach Florida State","description":"Georgia's Glenn Schumann, one of the country's top defensive coordinators and part of a staff that has the Bulldogs at No. 1 in the CFP rankings, agreed to a five-year deal to become the next coach at Florida State, the school announced Monday.","published":"2026-11-24T02:51:47.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577665/uga-defensive-coordinator-schumann-coach-florida-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"Andrea Adelson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Aiden Flora, nation's leading rusher, re-signs with Iowa State for next season","description":"Iowa State running back Aiden Flora, who leads the nation in rushing, announced Monday that he has re-signed with the Cyclones for next season.","published":"2026-11-23T23:57:14.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50577520/aiden-flora-nation-leading-rusher-re-signs-iowa-state","type":"HeadlineNews","byline":"David Wilson","source":"ESPN"},{"headline":"Texas A&M names John Thornton interim athletic director effective Dec. 1","description":"John Thornton will take over as interim athletic director at Texas A&M, effective Dec. 1, replacing the departed Trev Alberts.","published":"2026-11-23T22:07:34.000+00:00","url":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/story/_/id/50576559/texas-names-john-thornton-interim-ad-effective-dec-1","type":"HeadlineNews","source":"ESPN"}],"links":{"espn":"https://www.espn.com/college-football/player/_/id/5218506/brauntae-johnson","wikipedia":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brauntae_Johnson"},"pick":{"pick":56,"round":2,"team":"ATL","via":"JAX","provisional":true},"wiki":{"rules":4,"title":"Brauntae Johnson","url":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Brauntae_Johnson","description":"American football player","touched":"2026-11-22T04:18:08Z","intro":"Brauntae Ladarries Johnson, formerly known as Tae Johnson, is an American college football safety for the Notre Dame Fighting Irish.","sections":[{"key":"early","title":"Early life","text":"Johnson attended North Side High School in Fort Wayne, Indiana. He played wide receiver in high school and finished his career with 139 receptions for 2,286 yards and 41 touchdowns. He committed to the University of Notre Dame to play college football. Johnson also played basketball in high school."},{"key":"college","title":"College career","text":"In his first year at Notre Dame in 2024, Johnson missed time after undergoing foot surgery prior to the season. He returned from the injury to play in three games and redshirted. He entered his redshirt freshman season in 2025 as a backup before taking over as starting free safety against Arkansas."}]}}